{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/2mhjrdb7akw401jgmgpk8f8ozebg1h6.mp3","text":"您好。在今天的工作开始之前，请稍微给我一些，用于祈祷的时间......","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/15go83bsha5vyzreyrkhel18aiab0zk.mp3","text":"慈悲的使者，请守卫我的睡梦，保护我的心灵......","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/3dg2eyl11sc6n3r219xntpnia37ddrv.mp3","text":"呵呵，切割啊......切割是件很快乐的事。是啊，有些东西，相互之间并没有什么联系，从一开始，就不该结合在一起......","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/sn5xx2ye6uasubxuhy78wot2capw8bj.mp3","text":"呵呵呵......哈哈......哈哈哈哈......","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/p0arcmlq3mtxgiswaigrs6odvrg2ebn.mp3","text":"呵呵，为什么您要避开我的目光呢？这么做也是没用的......您想要的东西是什么，我全都知道。","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/2in7heqhivwf6paw78rqz6gpv2e8njl.mp3","text":"我一直、一直想带您去一个地方，一个能听到“秘密”的地方。","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:4/42/b3kplmc28nlttqpo057u8i5b0m3lxpy.mp3","text":"你们究竟对我做了什么......？为什么让我吃那种药？是谁把我带到这里的？请告诉我......！！！","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/dsu630sdjw8ah4fh5jwo8q8p7fa6ncr.mp3","text":"那个人告诉我的都是对的......解剖、撕裂、切碎，一切都是、都是给予他们的救赎！","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/92/7to7n59w2sdak6tiwt7wdv17p79oatc.mp3","text":"在您的梦中，经常会出现些无法理解的事物，是吗？呵，那些景象，是那个人向你投递来的，无望的信件。而我，作为那个人的使者，把它送到了，呵呵......","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/64/gnemzoxs0bzcs2h1onpfnk26qbzlydp.mp3","text":"......听，茫茫的万物之主，在黑暗中，喃喃自语......","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/kwdeh3td3ie9pogz18l2l2ug8omvh69.mp3","text":"幽灵鲨......那些‘死者’都这样称呼我。那位医生告诉我，继续获得治疗的条件，是为罗德岛而战。嗯，我会的，我会把我的力量，全都献给你们。","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/k9rx1lkgiffqrqsj690clrtcikpcpsm.mp3","text":"力量......流入了我的身体......","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/mhgso8prku0poz49i57886t8uy5l2h6.mp3","text":"你的意志，我无权违背......","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/kqxsoeh9eu5spit1k7xoexhy0fau6o9.mp3","text":"这样的职位，可以给我带来新的喜悦吗？还是说，为了你而战斗，才是我真正的快乐呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:9/91/btf9g42eilyk40uauudqeg4handmoei.mp3","text":"各位，晚安......","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/hjuomzcabvn72p5e9knwzx3qwgge0rt.mp3","text":"如您所愿。","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:6/63/baf27n6o3wf74v5vcpzv4nqa8vi46vi.mp3","text":"这将是一条，充满牺牲的道路。","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/7bkqwl9mrq1h7wpsy3welemq188m8eq.mp3","text":"我将这些迷失在战场上的灵魂，全部献给您......","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/fp2n6z61n3g9lzvvwo9hb2gt5q4ih08.mp3","text":"静候您的讯息。","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/juq07mkoh75geesey22cmq6kt8oyr84.mp3","text":"请告诉我结果。","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/im0nbwtqxgfl3ncttofjt5ngrixhb9l.mp3","text":"我来自深邃的海洋......","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/bejeh71t1s7qat7wgk83k27m8539wjp.mp3","text":"是您唤醒了我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/pbmvd9ezo6qybagpno2lrkib5hx69hq.mp3","text":"取悦我吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/r9i24ea5hxfqd8do5bhwlomqj2smv39.mp3","text":"回归深渊吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/94/1bk683dq1h6dtm1ckoksd9rcc9krdib.mp3","text":"没有价值的东西，我毫无兴趣。","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/rs5zl8ocn920zc2lyd8dwmlr4i79n5f.mp3","text":"不许逃走。","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/127rctakorwi0w5iivn8c2ev3vz7ujc.mp3","text":"我战胜了您给予我的全部考验，您看到了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/tqmfs18eywuat8facc3iovwp9t1fva8.mp3","text":"请将迷失的灵魂们，引渡到安息之地吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/24/jkaqa3a9adl87mnhtu540c0idoza05w.mp3","text":"......谁都，别想逃走！","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/f47ssxto89v8ko53dp6qlds4uadazie.mp3","text":"必须让他们偿还......必须......","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/q93gy1obvct3kyxucdmz7giaq5yau8o.mp3","text":"可以给我一个，看得见星星的房间吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/9kc0cuc83knygi776b8fholh4dxb2wc.mp3","text":"呵呵......","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/74b3xh9dikot8yutdf5tfvf4mxxvi5w.mp3","text":"博士......你背后究竟是什么样的力量......使我这样欣喜若狂呢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/sabi3r5sd26stc85m9te9sjyeh6r9dv.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/r6b8r9diw7cm0crah3jwyi5xmysbdvl.mp3","text":"又一年过去了吗？啊，在海中度过的岁月太漫长了，我已经不记得上一次自己是怎么度过的了......不提这个，告诉我吧，博士，今天，您想和我一起在窗台旁，看星星吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/kr2a9g1owv48cs64px4msjp6dh1vled.mp3","text":"你是......啊，这不是博士吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_143_ghost/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/86/nwweshaithvw6j3z3lrze4mxy2lmu83.mp3","text":"您好。在今天的工作开始之前，请稍微给我一些，用于祈祷的时间......","alt":"voice/char_143_ghost/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/c61x3qntb0q97ia7gixgjbzghp09suk.mp3","text":"慈悲的使者，请守卫我的睡梦，保护我的心灵......","alt":"voice/char_143_ghost/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/32/3oeiepksitgge2lq1iw5s6mu40xz8kv.mp3","text":"呵呵，切割啊......切割是件很快乐的事。是啊，有些东西，相互之间并没有什么联系，从一开始，就不该结合在一起......","alt":"voice/char_143_ghost/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/m5a8xvyyhm1oc1ggogmhhh8hq6eqlfj.mp3","text":"呵呵呵......哈哈......哈哈哈哈......","alt":"voice/char_143_ghost/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/42vxjtw1v5o87aypn1oqtmlkv0j7mfk.mp3","text":"呵呵，为什么您要避开我的目光呢？这么做也是没用的......您想要的东西是什么，我全都知道。","alt":"voice/char_143_ghost/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/7nhohkh2ve95ehjma7n3iuh1ts511fw.mp3","text":"我一直、一直想带您去一个地方，一个能听到“秘密”的地方。","alt":"voice/char_143_ghost/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"u